Backport of Dolibarr PR #41280 (develop, 2026-10-06): outstanding amount of a thirdparty computed by SQL
subqueries instead of 3 requests per opened invoice (tens of thousands on a customer with thousands of
opened invoices: 15-30 s customer card). Off by default, as upstream: MAIN_PERF_CALCULATE_OUTSTANDING_BILLS_BY_DB=1.
Also brings SOCIETE_OUTSTANDING_BILLS_FROM_DATE (YYYY-MM-DD). Applies to 22.0.5, 23.0.4, 24.0.2; skipped elsewhere.

